# compare Vue / Next.js / React

Issue #14: Voice BBS frontend stack comparison.

Current repository evidence is documented in `docs/compare-next-vue.md`. Vue/Next are measured in-repo; React is currently an unimplemented candidate and must not be represented as measured.

Decision candidate: continue Vue 3 + Vite for the current Voice BBS product; retain Next for rollback/comparison; evaluate React only through a controlled PoC.
